Segment #1   [00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,640] | Elapsed:  15.59s | Words: 9  | Text: 不方全的老板做不大的
Segment #2   [00:00:01,640 --> 00:00:03,020] | Elapsed:  15.59s | Words: 5  | Text: 我看到很多老板
Segment #3   [00:00:03,020 --> 00:00:04,780] | Elapsed:  15.59s | Words: 8  | Text: 他还在采用几千年前
Segment #4   [00:00:04,780 --> 00:00:07,380] | Elapsed:  15.59s | Words: 17 | Text: 亲手房创办的这种中央集权的管理模式
Segment #5   [00:00:07,380 --> 00:00:08,840] | Elapsed:  15.59s | Words: 8  | Text: 我就很心疼这些老板
Segment #6   [00:00:09,520 --> 00:00:10,440] | Elapsed:  15.59s | Words: 6  | Text: 这种管理模式
Segment #7   [00:00:10,440 --> 00:00:11,440] | Elapsed:  15.59s | Words: 6  | Text: 就老板自己当头
Segment #8   [00:00:11,440 --> 00:00:12,500] | Elapsed:  15.59s | Words: 6  | Text: 下面设几个部门
Segment #9   [00:00:12,500 --> 00:00:15,400] | Elapsed:  15.59s | Words: 11 | Text: 比如说音效部 市场部 人事部
Segment #10  [00:00:15,400 --> 00:00:17,460] | Elapsed:  15.59s | Words: 10 | Text: 然后每个部门都有自己的经历
Segment #11  [00:00:17,460 --> 00:00:19,720] | Elapsed:  15.59s | Words: 15 | Text: 然后这个老板就带领了这几个部门打仗
Segment #12  [00:00:19,720 --> 00:00:21,980] | Elapsed:  15.59s | Words: 9  | Text: 指挥这几个部门行动
Segment #13  [00:00:21,980 --> 00:00:23,040] | Elapsed:  15.59s | Words: 5  | Text: 然后他们去赚钱
Segment #14  [00:00:23,440 --> 00:00:25,320] | Elapsed:  15.59s | Words: 9  | Text: 这种模式在现在自由社会
Segment #15  [00:00:25,320 --> 00:00:27,520] | Elapsed:  15.59s | Words: 14 | Text: 他只能把老板越来越累 给他累死
Segment #16  [00:00:27,520 --> 00:00:28,940] | Elapsed:  15.59s | Words: 7  | Text: 因为大家越来越聪明
Segment #17  [00:00:28,940 --> 00:00:30,340] | Elapsed:  32.96s | Words: 9  | Text: 市场经营越来越细粉
Segment #18  [00:00:30,340 --> 00:00:31,900] | Elapsed:  32.96s | Words: 8  | Text: 分工越来越精细化
Segment #19  [00:00:31,900 --> 00:00:33,580] | Elapsed:  32.96s | Words: 9  | Text: 你老板不可能又懂市场
Segment #20  [00:00:33,580 --> 00:00:34,120] | Elapsed:  32.96s | Words: 4  | Text: 又懂顾客
Segment #21  [00:00:34,120 --> 00:00:35,120] | Elapsed:  32.96s | Words: 5  | Text: 你还懂生产
Segment #22  [00:00:35,120 --> 00:00:35,800] | Elapsed:  32.96s | Words: 4  | Text: 又懂财务
Segment #23  [00:00:35,800 --> 00:00:36,460] | Elapsed:  32.96s | Words: 4  | Text: 还懂人事
Segment #24  [00:00:36,460 --> 00:00:37,600] | Elapsed:  32.96s | Words: 5  | Text: 还懂互联网
Segment #25  [00:00:37,600 --> 00:00:40,140] | Elapsed:  32.96s | Words: 11 | Text: 而且人的自由意识在不停觉醒
Segment #26  [00:00:40,140 --> 00:00:44,100] | Elapsed:  32.96s | Words: 10 | Text: 特别是现在互联网的时代
Segment #27  [00:00:44,100 --> 00:00:46,680] | Elapsed:  32.96s | Words: 11 | Text: 很多的00后参与到社会工作中
Segment #28  [00:00:46,680 --> 00:00:47,720] | Elapsed:  32.96s | Words: 4  | Text: 他们很专业
Segment #29  [00:00:47,720 --> 00:00:50,000] | Elapsed:  32.96s | Words: 12 | Text: 但是他们不愿意去听老板的表达
Segment #30  [00:00:50,000 --> 00:00:51,960] | Elapsed:  32.96s | Words: 8  | Text: 你老板你又不是皇帝
Segment #31  [00:00:51,960 --> 00:00:52,880] | Elapsed:  32.96s | Words: 5  | Text: 你也没有军队
Segment #32  [00:00:52,880 --> 00:00:53,820] | Elapsed:  32.96s | Words: 5  | Text: 你就发点工资
Segment #33  [00:00:53,820 --> 00:00:55,260] | Elapsed:  32.96s | Words: 5  | Text: 只有没有什么用的人
Segment #34  [00:00:55,260 --> 00:00:56,320] | Elapsed:  32.96s | Words: 4  | Text: 找不到工作的人
Segment #35  [00:00:56,320 --> 00:00:57,240] | Elapsed:  32.96s | Words: 7  | Text: 他才会跟着你混
Segment #36  [00:00:57,580 --> 00:00:59,020] | Elapsed:  50.69s | Words: 8  | Text: 没有办法的他才听你的
Segment #37  [00:00:59,660 --> 00:01:00,620] | Elapsed:  50.69s | Words: 5  | Text: 也就是说这种
Segment #38  [00:01:01,240 --> 00:01:02,540] | Elapsed:  50.69s | Words: 9  | Text: 中央集权的管理模式
Segment #39  [00:01:02,540 --> 00:01:04,360] | Elapsed:  50.69s | Words: 10 | Text: 它是吸引不到优秀的人才的
Segment #40  [00:01:04,360 --> 00:01:05,600] | Elapsed:  50.69s | Words: 5  | Text: 在现在这个社会
Segment #41  [00:01:05,600 --> 00:01:06,480] | Elapsed:  50.69s | Words: 5  | Text: 谁都不服管
Segment #42  [00:01:06,480 --> 00:01:07,720] | Elapsed:  50.70s | Words: 5  | Text: 都不喜欢被管
Segment #43  [00:01:07,720 --> 00:01:09,220] | Elapsed:  50.70s | Words: 4  | Text: 那我的给大家
Segment #44  [00:01:10,720 --> 00:01:12,740] | Elapsed:  50.70s | Words: 11 | Text: 拿我自己当案例给你们拆分一下
Segment #45  [00:01:12,740 --> 00:01:14,040] | Elapsed:  50.70s | Words: 5  | Text: 就在我的公司
Segment #46  [00:01:14,040 --> 00:01:16,040] | Elapsed:  50.70s | Words: 11 | Text: 我所有的员工不必听我的指挥
Segment #47  [00:01:16,040 --> 00:01:17,360] | Elapsed:  50.70s | Words: 7  | Text: 我也没有任何的要求
Segment #48  [00:01:17,360 --> 00:01:19,040] | Elapsed:  50.70s | Words: 8  | Text: 你都可以拖鞋来上班
Segment #49  [00:01:19,040 --> 00:01:20,040] | Elapsed:  50.70s | Words: 5  | Text: 我只抓业务
Segment #50  [00:01:20,040 --> 00:01:20,960] | Elapsed:  50.70s | Words: 5  | Text: 只要你出伙
Segment #51  [00:01:20,960 --> 00:01:21,600] | Elapsed:  50.70s | Words: 3  | Text: 什么都可以
Segment #52  [00:01:21,600 --> 00:01:22,840] | Elapsed:  50.70s | Words: 4  | Text: 你为谁工作
Segment #53  [00:01:22,840 --> 00:01:23,880] | Elapsed:  50.70s | Words: 5  | Text: 你就听谁指挥
Segment #54  [00:01:23,880 --> 00:01:25,020] | Elapsed:  50.70s | Words: 7  | Text: 你服务哪个部门
Segment #55  [00:01:25,020 --> 00:01:25,960] | Elapsed:  50.70s | Words: 5  | Text: 就是哪些员工
Segment #56  [00:01:25,960 --> 00:01:27,100] | Elapsed:  50.70s | Words: 6  | Text: 你就听谁的指挥
Segment #57  [00:01:27,600 --> 00:01:28,300] | Elapsed:  69.69s | Words: 5  | Text: 在这个过程中
Segment #58  [00:01:28,300 --> 00:01:29,660] | Elapsed:  69.69s | Words: 7  | Text: 他们也能更好地去
Segment #59  [00:01:30,240 --> 00:01:31,760] | Elapsed:  69.69s | Words: 9  | Text: 明白了自己对接哪个部门
Segment #60  [00:01:31,760 --> 00:01:32,500] | Elapsed:  69.69s | Words: 5  | Text: 或者说哪个人
Segment #61  [00:01:32,500 --> 00:01:33,220] | Elapsed:  69.69s | Words: 4  | Text: 他服务好了
Segment #62  [00:01:33,220 --> 00:01:34,260] | Elapsed:  69.69s | Words: 5  | Text: 他就成神官
Segment #63  [00:01:34,260 --> 00:01:35,880] | Elapsed:  69.69s | Words: 6  | Text: 就是你的市场在哪
Segment #64  [00:01:35,880 --> 00:01:36,660] | Elapsed:  69.69s | Words: 5  | Text: 你的客户在哪
Segment #65  [00:01:36,660 --> 00:01:37,720] | Elapsed:  69.69s | Words: 7  | Text: 这是你需要关心的问题
Segment #66  [00:01:37,720 --> 00:01:39,060] | Elapsed:  69.69s | Words: 8  | Text: 你不用关心我这个老板
Segment #67  [00:01:39,060 --> 00:01:39,720] | Elapsed:  69.69s | Words: 4  | Text: 我在想什么事
Segment #68  [00:01:39,720 --> 00:01:42,040] | Elapsed:  69.69s | Words: 9  | Text: 我也不会去指挥你去干什么
Segment #69  [00:01:42,040 --> 00:01:43,900] | Elapsed:  69.69s | Words: 8  | Text: 大家也可以民主的去选举
Segment #70  [00:01:43,900 --> 00:01:44,980] | Elapsed:  69.69s | Words: 7  | Text: 你部门这几个人
Segment #71  [00:01:44,980 --> 00:01:46,220] | Elapsed:  69.69s | Words: 5  | Text: 就直接可以选一个
Segment #72  [00:01:46,220 --> 00:01:47,540] | Elapsed:  69.69s | Words: 6  | Text: 你们认为能够去
Segment #73  [00:01:47,540 --> 00:01:48,660] | Elapsed:  69.69s | Words: 7  | Text: 带你赚更多钱的人
Segment #74  [00:01:48,660 --> 00:01:49,480] | Elapsed:  69.69s | Words: 4  | Text: 来当经理
Segment #75  [00:01:49,480 --> 00:01:50,860] | Elapsed:  69.69s | Words: 8  | Text: 那我批准执行就好了
Segment #76  [00:01:50,860 --> 00:01:51,600] | Elapsed:  69.69s | Words: 2  | Text: 那这样
Segment #77  [00:01:51,600 --> 00:01:53,040] | Elapsed:  69.69s | Words: 8  | Text: 他就会面临一个什么问题
Segment #78  [00:01:53,780 --> 00:01:54,620] | Elapsed:  69.69s | Words: 4  | Text: 效率非常高
Segment #79  [00:01:55,060 --> 00:01:57,220] | Elapsed:  88.25s | Words: 13 | Text: 人事部就一心一意的去服务好
Segment #80  [00:01:57,220 --> 00:01:58,820] | Elapsed:  88.25s | Words: 7  | Text: 这些要人的部门
Segment #81  [00:01:58,820 --> 00:01:59,760] | Elapsed:  88.25s | Words: 5  | Text: 那财务部的人
Segment #82  [00:02:00,300 --> 00:02:01,940] | Elapsed:  88.26s | Words: 8  | Text: 就服务好这个公司的
Segment #83  [00:02:01,940 --> 00:02:02,820] | Elapsed:  88.26s | Words: 5  | Text: 这个眉笔进账
Segment #84  [00:02:02,820 --> 00:02:04,380] | Elapsed:  88.26s | Words: 8  | Text: 那销售的就好好开单
Segment #85  [00:02:04,380 --> 00:02:05,840] | Elapsed:  88.26s | Words: 10 | Text: 流量部的就好好去做流量
Segment #86  [00:02:05,840 --> 00:02:07,560] | Elapsed:  88.26s | Words: 10 | Text: 公司他就自动化运转了
Segment #87  [00:02:07,560 --> 00:02:08,340] | Elapsed:  88.26s | Words: 4  | Text: 他不需要我
Segment #88  [00:02:08,340 --> 00:02:10,560] | Elapsed:  88.26s | Words: 11 | Text: 再去每天给他们去安排什么工作
Segment #89  [00:02:10,560 --> 00:02:11,700] | Elapsed:  88.26s | Words: 3  | Text: 而我呢
Segment #90  [00:02:11,700 --> 00:02:12,680] | Elapsed:  88.26s | Words: 4  | Text: 我只负责
Segment #91  [00:02:12,680 --> 00:02:14,180] | Elapsed:  88.26s | Words: 10 | Text: 就把这几个部门的经理
Segment #92  [00:02:14,180 --> 00:02:14,660] | Elapsed:  88.26s | Words: 3  | Text: 交在一起
Segment #93  [00:02:14,660 --> 00:02:15,820] | Elapsed:  88.26s | Words: 7  | Text: 大家们是一起开开会
Segment #94  [00:02:15,820 --> 00:02:17,720] | Elapsed:  88.26s | Words: 10 | Text: 调节调节你们之间的矛盾
Segment #95  [00:02:17,720 --> 00:02:19,260] | Elapsed:  88.26s | Words: 6  | Text: 你别做流量的
Segment #96  [00:02:19,260 --> 00:02:20,520] | Elapsed:  88.26s | Words: 5  | Text: 说人转化不好
Segment #97  [00:02:20,520 --> 00:02:22,240] | Elapsed:  88.26s | Words: 9  | Text: 做转化的说流量太犯
Segment #98  [00:02:22,620 --> 00:02:24,360] | Elapsed: 106.57s | Words: 10 | Text: 然后呢我服务了几个经理
Segment #99  [00:02:24,360 --> 00:02:25,400] | Elapsed: 106.57s | Words: 3  | Text: 我也发现
Segment #100 [00:02:25,400 --> 00:02:27,380] | Elapsed: 106.57s | Words: 10 | Text: 就是大家的积极性变得很高
Segment #101 [00:02:27,380 --> 00:02:28,620] | Elapsed: 106.57s | Words: 4  | Text: 我天天我
Segment #102 [00:02:28,620 --> 00:02:29,720] | Elapsed: 106.57s | Words: 6  | Text: 我再去服务他们
Segment #103 [00:02:29,720 --> 00:02:31,600] | Elapsed: 106.57s | Words: 6  | Text: 我只服务经理
Segment #104 [00:02:31,600 --> 00:02:32,880] | Elapsed: 106.57s | Words: 7  | Text: 每个人的成就感
Segment #105 [00:02:32,880 --> 00:02:33,640] | Elapsed: 106.57s | Words: 5  | Text: 每个人都在
Segment #106 [00:02:33,640 --> 00:02:35,600] | Elapsed: 106.57s | Words: 7  | Text: 就是发挥自己的智慧
Segment #107 [00:02:35,600 --> 00:02:37,100] | Elapsed: 106.57s | Words: 8  | Text: 我反而比较轻松的
Segment #108 [00:02:37,100 --> 00:02:38,000] | Elapsed: 106.57s | Words: 4  | Text: 而业绩呢
Segment #109 [00:02:38,000 --> 00:02:39,360] | Elapsed: 106.57s | Words: 6  | Text: 就是居然比我以前
Segment #110 [00:02:39,360 --> 00:02:40,480] | Elapsed: 106.57s | Words: 6  | Text: 我自己坑是坑是
Segment #111 [00:02:40,480 --> 00:02:41,320] | Elapsed: 106.57s | Words: 5  | Text: 带对指挥的时候
Segment #112 [00:02:41,320 --> 00:02:42,700] | Elapsed: 106.57s | Words: 8  | Text: 高出这么大一大劫的
Segment #113 [00:02:42,700 --> 00:02:43,620] | Elapsed: 106.57s | Words: 4  | Text: 然后后来呢
Segment #114 [00:02:43,620 --> 00:02:45,040] | Elapsed: 106.57s | Words: 8  | Text: 我就读经济管理学的时候
Segment #115 [00:02:45,040 --> 00:02:45,620] | Elapsed: 106.57s | Words: 3  | Text: 我就发现
Segment #116 [00:02:45,620 --> 00:02:47,200] | Elapsed: 106.57s | Words: 6  | Text: 以前的管理模式
Segment #117 [00:02:47,740 --> 00:02:49,520] | Elapsed: 106.57s | Words: 12 | Text: 纯粹是计划经济的管理模式
Segment #118 [00:02:49,520 --> 00:02:50,160] | Elapsed: 106.57s | Words: 3  | Text: 而我现在
Segment #119 [00:02:50,660 --> 00:02:52,120] | Elapsed: 123.69s | Words: 9  | Text: 套用的这种管理体系
Segment #120 [00:02:52,120 --> 00:02:53,720] | Elapsed: 123.69s | Words: 11 | Text: 它是市场经济的管理模式
Segment #121 [00:02:53,720 --> 00:02:54,660] | Elapsed: 123.69s | Words: 4  | Text: 一般情况下
Segment #122 [00:02:54,660 --> 00:02:56,920] | Elapsed: 123.69s | Words: 11 | Text: 市场经济都强于计划经济
Segment #123 [00:02:56,920 --> 00:02:58,100] | Elapsed: 123.69s | Words: 7  | Text: 那可能你把这个思想
Segment #124 [00:02:59,120 --> 00:03:00,700] | Elapsed: 123.69s | Words: 9  | Text: 把这个思想用到管理上
Segment #125 [00:03:00,700 --> 00:03:02,160] | Elapsed: 123.69s | Words: 8  | Text: 我感觉它也是通用的
Segment #126 [00:03:02,160 --> 00:03:04,060] | Elapsed: 123.69s | Words: 7  | Text: 所以说老板你不要自己
Segment #127 [00:03:04,060 --> 00:03:05,480] | Elapsed: 123.69s | Words: 7  | Text: 总想当青人皇了
Segment #128 [00:03:05,480 --> 00:03:08,320] | Elapsed: 123.69s | Words: 13 | Text: 青人皇在厉害他要活不了五千岁
Segment #129 [00:03:08,320 --> 00:03:08,720] | Elapsed: 123.69s | Words: 1  | Text: 是不是
Segment #130 [00:03:08,720 --> 00:03:09,940] | Elapsed: 123.69s | Words: 7  | Text: 该放学的时候你放权
Segment #131 [00:03:09,940 --> 00:03:10,820] | Elapsed: 123.69s | Words: 6  | Text: 让下面人干净完了
Segment #132 [00:03:11,240 --> 00:03:12,580] | Elapsed: 123.69s | Words: 6  | Text: 你自己坑是坑是
Segment #133 [00:03:12,580 --> 00:03:13,820] | Elapsed: 123.69s | Words: 6  | Text: 把所有活都干了
Segment #134 [00:03:15,100 --> 00:03:16,240] | Elapsed: 123.69s | Words: 4  | Text: 我觉得太累了
Segment #135 [00:03:16,240 --> 00:03:17,660] | Elapsed: 123.69s | Words: 9  | Text: 这种模式是赚不到钱的
Segment #136 [00:03:17,660 --> 00:03:18,680] | Elapsed: 123.69s | Words: 7  | Text: 虽然看自己是老板
Segment #137 [00:03:18,680 --> 00:03:20,140] | Elapsed: 134.78s | Words: 9  | Text: 但本质你还是一个打工者
Segment #138 [00:03:20,140 --> 00:03:21,220] | Elapsed: 134.78s | Words: 6  | Text: 你是在为自己打工
Segment #139 [00:03:21,220 --> 00:03:22,800] | Elapsed: 134.78s | Words: 7  | Text: 有一天当你不干的时候
Segment #140 [00:03:22,800 --> 00:03:24,160] | Elapsed: 134.78s | Words: 6  | Text: 你的团队也不能打
Segment #141 [00:03:24,160 --> 00:03:26,340] | Elapsed: 134.78s | Words: 7  | Text: 你这个瘫子就烦了
Segment #142 [00:03:26,340 --> 00:03:27,080] | Elapsed: 134.78s | Words: 4  | Text: 也算不到钱
Segment #143 [00:03:27,820 --> 00:03:29,300] | Elapsed: 134.78s | Words: 11 | Text: 这样我发现助女们越来越好
Segment #144 [00:03:29,300 --> 00:03:30,380] | Elapsed: 134.78s | Words: 9  | Text: 以后不给你们料鸡汤了
Segment #145 [00:03:30,380 --> 00:03:31,040] | Elapsed: 134.78s | Words: 6  | Text: 还给你们料干活
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
